   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Symbiocity marketing Swedish Association of Local Authorities and Regions/SKL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen innefattar att h&#xE5;lla ett seminarium i Denpasar d&#xE4;r svenska konceptet SymbioCity presenteras f&#xF6;r utvalda indonesiska kommuner. Syftet a&#xE4;r att facilitera framtida partnerskap mellan svenska och indonesiska kommuner kring h&#xE5;llbar urban planering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is about holding a seminar in Denpasar where the Swedish Symbiocity approach is presented to Indonesian municipalities. The purpose is to facilitate future partnerships between Indonesian and Swedish municipalities and possibly municipal associations regarding sustainable urban planning. The result (Oct 2012) has been two partnerships proposed (1 approved) so far.</narrative>
  </description>
